WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Dhalsim sends a projectile toward Ryu from long range.

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.430
After the fireballs collide, Drive Rush standing heavy kick punishes Ryu.

3
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.180
Dhalsim teleports to the opposite side before continuing on landing.

4
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.430
Back medium kick leads into OD Yoga Flame.

5
00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.630
Standing heavy kick catches the airborne opponent.

6
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:07.200
Level 1 completes the side-switch punish.
